ype": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe past experiences in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le10ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "break"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short time of rest to break up the workday"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The workers took a short coffee break."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk with colleagues."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workday"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a day on which you work at a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He would write marketing plans on a typical workday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have a seat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take a rest sitting down"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She asked her friend to have a seat during their coffee break."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to survey"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to check out an area in search of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shoppers would survey the market for a certain product."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come up with"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to discover the answer to something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He would always come up with a strategy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to find out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to know for the first time; to realize"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He wanted to find out the sales goals for his co-worker."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect and Past Simple Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use the <span class=\"strong\">PRESENT PERFECT</span> tense to talk about an action or event that is connected to the present in some way.<br><br>   You use the <span class=\"strong\">SIMPLE PAST</span> tense to talk about a finished action or event not connected to the present. <br><br>  When you use the <span class=\"strong\">PRESENT PERFECT</span> tense, there is a connection between what happened in the past and now. You can use time markers like <span class=\"italic\">for, just</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ever</span>. <br><br>  When you use the <span class=\"strong\">SIMPLE PAST</span> tense, the time is always in the past. You can use time markers like: span class=\"italic\">then, ago, yesterday, when I was \u2026</span> <br><br>  Look at the chart to see how to form the <span class=\"strong\">PRESENT PERFECT</span> tense: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Base form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past tense form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"try\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have tried to cut down on the amount of coffee I drink.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have done\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't done this type of project before.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How has your job been?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"learn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"learned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have learned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have learned a lot from my colleagues here.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Habits of the Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> express a pattern of action that occurred regularly in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Both <span class=\"italic\"> used to </span>  and <span class=\"italic\"> would </span>  are followed by the base form of the verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> + verb <br/><span class=\"italic\">I used to take a walk everyday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">would</span> + verb <br/><span class=\"italic\">I would walk 3 miles every evening</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I used to make myself a cappuccino every morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would get up a little earlier to heat up the machine.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I used to have 6 cups of coffee during the workday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Every hour I would go back for another cup.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I used to write marketing plans.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would survey the market for that product.<br>I would find out the sales goals.<br>I would come up with a strategy. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write down 3 new things you have experienced in the last 2 years."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 3 things you have stopped doing in the last 2 years."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use Present Perfect tense in your sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your 6 sentences to your partner. Ask them about their experiences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements on new experiences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express habits I have stopped. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I exchange ideas about experiences with my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}